id=hma-uidfake
name=HMA UID Fake
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=Kodatemitsuru
description=Fake UID for apps that are "risk", so that they can not be detected by uid scanners. This module is for advanced users only, and it may cause issues with some apps. Use at your own risk. 伪装UID给那些被认为是“风险”的应用程序，以便它们无法被UID扫描器检测到。此模块仅适用于高级用户，并且可能会导致某些应用程序出现问题。请自行承担风险使用。
